# Stage 1B distilled static-embedder artifacts are model weights too (~30 MB):
# regenerate with scripts/distill_static_embedder.py. The committed parity
# contract is fixtures/golden_embeddings.f32 + the #[ignore] golden_parity
# test in skinki-vector. The hand-built 4 KB toy fixture stays committed.
fixtures/static_embed_*.skemb
!fixtures/static_embed_toy.skemb

